    <!-- Access model (see CLAUDE.md > Permissions): every permission below is its
         own privilege with one "Allowed" group, whose record rules give it its
         meaning. All of them imply the technical Property user group, which
         holds the ACLs and a deny rule per operation, so users can only do what
         a permission opens. "Own" is what they created or are named on
         (Property Manager / Responsible). Photos and floor plans follow their
         property. Everyone who can raise leases or contracts can read the
         properties, to pick one. This file is generated: keep its rules in step
         across the three record types. -->
